</span><span begin="00:09.634" end="00:09.850">when </span><span begin="00:09.850" end="00:10.072">I </span><span begin="00:10.072" end="00:10.423">come </span><span begin="00:10.423" end="00:11.062">back </span><span begin="00:11.062" end="00:11.461">you'll </span><span begin="00:11.461" end="00:12.076">know </span><span begin="00:12.076" end="00:12.772">know </span><span begin="00:12.772" end="00:12.882">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.886" end="00:19.755"><span begin="00:14.886" end="00:15.062">I </span><span begin="00:15.062" end="00:15.261">ain't </span><span begin="00:15.261" end="00:15.628">got </span><span begin="00:15.628" end="00:16.091">the </span><span begin="00:16.091" end="00:17.506">time </span><span begin="00:17.506" end="00:17.689">and </span><span begin="00:17.689" end="00:17.832">if </span><span begin="00:17.832" end="00:18.023">my </span><span begin="00:18.023" end="00:18.638">daddy </span><span begin="00:18.638" end="00:19.229">thinks </span><span begin="00:19.229" end="00:19.396">I'm </span><span begin="00:19.396" end="00:19.755">fine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.231" end="00:26.233"><span begin="00:21.231" end="00:21.422">He's </span><span begin="00:21.422" end="00:21.613">tried </span><span begin="00:21.613" end="00:21.812">to </span><span begin="00:21.812" end="00:22.011">make </span><span begin="00:22.011" end="00:22.210">me </span><span begin="00:22.210" end="00:22.497">go </span><span begin="00:22.497" end="00:22.776">to </span><span begin="00:22.776" end="00:23.895">rehab </span><span begin="00:23.895" end="00:24.062">but </span><span begin="00:24.062" end="00:24.221">I </span><span begin="00:24.221" end="00:24.428">won't </span><span begin="00:24.428" end="00:25.155">go </span><span begin="00:25.155" end="00:26.019">go </span><span begin="00:26.019" end="00:26.233">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.735" end="00:31.816"><span begin="00:28.735" end="00:28.942">I'd </span><span begin="00:28.942" end="00: