class</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.583" end="01:06.642"><span begin="01:00.583" end="01:00.750">But </span><span begin="01:00.750" end="01:00.909">I </span><span begin="01:00.909" end="01:01.828">know </span><span begin="01:01.828" end="01:01.987">it </span><span begin="01:01.987" end="01:02.987">don't </span><span begin="01:02.987" end="01:04.050">come </span><span begin="01:04.050" end="01:04.741">in </span><span begin="01:04.741" end="01:05.500">a </span><span begin="01:05.500" end="01:06.523">shot </span><span begin="01:06.523" end="01:06.642">glass</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.580" end="01:12.006"><span begin="01:07.580" end="01:07.779">They </span><span begin="01:07.779" end="01:07.954">tried </span><span begin="01:07.954" end="01:08.137">to </span><span begin="01:08.137" end="01:08.296">make </span><span begin="01:08.296" end="01:08.471">me </span><span begin="01:08.471" end="01:08.822">go </span><span begin="01:08.822" end="01:09.029">to </span><span begin="01:09.029" end="01:09.963">rehab </span><span begin="01:09.963" end="01:10.131">but </span><span begin="01:10.131" end="01:10.306">I </span><span begin="01:10.306" end="01:10.465">said </span><span begin="01:10.465" end="01:11.232">no </span><span begin="01:11.232" end="01:11.903">no </span><span begin="01:11.903" end="01:12.006">no</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.876" end="01:18.799"><span begin="01:13.876" end="01:14.235">Yes </span><span begin="01:14.235" end="01:14.434">I've </span><span begin="01:14.434" end="01:14.673">been </span><span begin="01:14.673" end="01:15.417">black </span><span begin="01:15.417" end="01:15.592">but </span><span begin="01:15.592" end="01:15.751">when </span><span begin="01:15.751" end="01:15.958">I </span><span begin="01:15.958" end="01:16.102">come </span><span begin="01:16.102" end="01:17.044">back </span><span begin="01:17.044" end="01:17.251">you'll </span><span begin="01:17.251" end="01:17.882">know </span><span begin="01:17.882" end="