24" end="01:37.684">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.621" end="01:43.866"><span begin="01:40.621" end="01:40.919">I </span><span begin="01:40.919" end="01:42.214">said </span><span begin="01:42.214" end="01:42.477">I </span><span begin="01:42.477" end="01:42.803">got </span><span begin="01:42.803" end="01:43.555">no </span><span begin="01:43.555" end="01:43.866">idea</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.969" end="01:50.272"><span begin="01:46.969" end="01:47.175">I'm </span><span begin="01:47.175" end="01:48.557">gonna </span><span begin="01:48.557" end="01:48.756">I'm </span><span begin="01:48.756" end="01:49.363">gonna </span><span begin="01:49.363" end="01:49.778">lose </span><span begin="01:49.778" end="01:50.033">my </span><span begin="01:50.033" end="01:50.272">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.679" end="01:58.832"><span begin="01:53.679" end="01:54.078">So </span><span begin="01:54.078" end="01:55.237">I </span><span begin="01:55.237" end="01:56.284">always </span><span begin="01:56.284" end="01:56.443">keep </span><span begin="01:56.443" end="01:56.762">a </span><span begin="01:56.762" end="01:58.601">bottle </span><span begin="01:58.601" end="01:58.832">near</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.559" end="02:03.800"><span begin="02:01.559" end="02:01.774">He </span><span begin="02:01.774" end="02:01.980">said </span><span begin="02:01.980" end="02:02.156">I </span><span begin="02:02.156" end="02:02.355">just </span><span begin="02:02.355" end="02:02.817">think </span><span begin="02:02.817" end="02:03.017">your </span><span begin="02:03.017" end="02:03.800">depressed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.001" end="02:12.030"><span begin="02:07.001" end="02:07.222">This </span><span begin="02:07.222" end="02:08.531">me </span><span begin="02:08.531" end="02:08.962">yeah </span><span begin="02:08.962" end="02:10.593">baby </span><span begin="02:10.593" end="02:10.760">and </span><span begin="02:10.760" end="02:11.903">the </